{"unit_id": "Qingzhu093__dsh-latex-studio#feature-1", "repo": "Qingzhu093/dsh-latex-studio", "commit": "b52daa406748dd568293a27e0908148f9f81a7d4", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-latex-studio 的功能「LaTeX 编译」：编译 LaTeX 工程并返回 PDF、页数和结构化错误；优先使用 latexmk，否则使用内置多趟驱动。通过 latex_build 提交项目目录。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/tools/daily.js:267"]}
{"unit_id": "Qingzhu093__dsh-latex-studio#feature-2", "repo": "Qingzhu093/dsh-latex-studio", "commit": "b52daa406748dd568293a27e0908148f9f81a7d4", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-latex-studio 的功能「源码诊断」：静态检查 LaTeX 源码中的引用、标签和版面相关规则，并返回问题清单；可选调用 chktex 提供额外提示。通过 latex_lint 指定项目和可选规则。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/tools/daily.js:330"]}
